G0352.def:
**άνα-κύπτω**
[in LXX: [[Job.10.15|Job.10:15]] (נָשָׂא רֹאשׁ), Dan LXX, [[Sus.1.35|Su 1:35]] * ;]
**to lift oneself up**;
(a) **bodily**; [[Luk.13.11|Luk.13:11]], [[Jhn.8.7, 10|Jhn.8:7, 10]];
(b) **mentally, to be elated**: [[Luk.21.28|Luk.21:28]] (cf. MM, _VGT_, see word).†
(AS)

G0387.def:
**ἀνα-στατόω**, ῶ
(ἀνάστατος, driven from home; ἀνίστημι), [in LXX: [[Dan.7.23|Dan.7:23]] (דּוּשׁ;* also in Aq., and in π. (see Deiss., _LAE_, 80 f.; MM, _VGT_, see word),]
**to stir up, excite, unsettle**: with accusative;
(a) **to tumult and sedition**: [[Act.17.6; 21.38|Act.17:6 21:38]];
(b) **by false teaching**: [[Gal.5.12|Gal.5:12]] (see Milligan, _NTD_, 73 f.).†
(AS)
